            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Reduce after each `+ - *`",
                "Fix negatives: `((a%m)+m)%m`",
                "{red:Never divide}: multiply by the ==inverse==",
                "`lcm = a / gcd * b`, divide first"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
