              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. GCD and Primes",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`gcd(a,b) = gcd(b, a%b)`, ==O(log n)==",
                "**gcd x lcm = a x b**",
                "Trial division: ==O(sqrt n)==",
                "Sieve: ==O(n log log n)==, inner loop starts at `i*i`",
                "==spf sieve== gives factorization in O(log x)"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
